openmediavault-qnapx39 (7.5.1) stable; urgency=low

  * The green bay lights blink on disk activity again: the plugin keeps
    the BIOS blink signal on GP26 (Front panel option, on by default).
    The same signal blinks the green Status light; untick the option
    for a solid Status light without activity blinking.

