openmediavault-qnapx39 (7.5.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Fan modes as in QTS: Quiet, Normal, Performance, Custom and Fixed.
  * System > QNAP > Front panel: Status light, disk and USB lights, bay
    map, volume-full threshold, lights off at night, front LCD and what
    to do after a power cut (ICH7 AFTERG1: on, off or BIOS).
  * System > QNAP > System: Device and Processor & memory tabs.
